GPLv3 §7(b) additional terms inherited from upstream
-----------------------------------------------------

The Morphe project applies GPLv3 §7(b) additional terms to its own code (see
https://morphe.software and the NOTICE file of `instagram-morphe-patches-library`), which
include a restriction against using the "Morphe" name/branding as the name of a derivative
project. InstaSave complies with this by using its own distinct name and branding, and by
linking against Morphe's libraries as a build dependency rather than redistributing their
source under the InstaSave name.

Any code copied (rather than depended upon) from Morphe or its libraries retains its original
